 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_3dbc4ed1a08d1d249695",
   "sourceHash": "3dbc4ed1a08d1d249695c4ca9b382e6d7314a5ba59c7eb64adb50af8a9fc498e",
   "text": "亲爱的朋友们：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7322c614321f80009050",
   "sourceHash": "7322c614321f80009050f107763a2b2ff7bfc4f33d9b51b55e134a0e966d2d78",
   "text": "我们的目标不仅是提供阿育吠陀护理，更是倡导一种重视心理、精神与身体健康的生活方式。我们希望通过个性化疗法、治疗性饮食、瑜伽课程和冥想练习，帮助患者过上更好、更充实的生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a7cc933134040a8acc94",
   "sourceHash": "a7cc933134040a8acc94fe3c50eeeed3d9515752bb39aa7ab88c64f37dd86496",
   "text": "我向每一位来到Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village的朋友致以衷心的感谢。您对阿育吠陀和Kairali的信任，激励着我们不断创新与进步。诚邀您在阿育吠陀永恒原则的指引下，开启这一自我发现、疗愈与焕新的转变过程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9b5cb23835c65fb7de17",
   "sourceHash": "9b5cb23835c65fb7de17f9efd21c63b428e1b8288039e62e0c831e59a947ab9d",
   "text": "关于 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village：位于喀拉拉邦帕拉卡德、获 NABH 认证的阿育吠陀医院，提供由医师主导的治疗方案。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9233ac3f1faa987063d6",
   "sourceHash": "9233ac3f1faa987063d651d815a4f93e1612fc0ea62b6c728fd87a2a75f4831f",
   "text": "曾在 Kairali - The Ayurvedic Healing Village 接受治疗的患者分享他们的体会，讲述积极的变化以及希望再次到访的心愿。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3bc45feae5c5d277773b",
   "sourceHash": "3bc45feae5c5d277773b99bb638f2493c62876387322aee51a4866c1e2b8a80a",
   "text": "阿育吠陀疗法和按摩已帮助许多人更好地应对日常生活的节奏。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b515ed04a8e2f206dda7",
   "sourceHash": "b515ed04a8e2f206dda7a022d509e25647c64b6a2f1203e1a22f8604d1ce0a86",
   "text": "一位患者对 Kairali 提供的阿育吠陀 Panchakarma（五业排毒）疗法的评价",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_36e37d0c35b72124b58d",
   "sourceHash": "36e37d0c35b72124b58dd3a6072887e334ee005468a365343cc6212dd405719c",
   "text": "播放视频 — 一位患者对 Kairali 提供的阿育吠陀 Panchakarma（五业排毒）疗法的评价",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3efbd92397bdbb84f208",
   "sourceHash": "3efbd92397bdbb84f208e790c613aca57d3d38bc85bbb3d5b079086c4c94111d",
   "text": "Kairali 患者视频评价，一名女子坐在白色扶手椅上",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_234814f6a44b14461759",
   "sourceHash": "234814f6a44b14461759a8a026080427efbf320c51bc422ddcf1e98d87d8676b",
   "text": "椰树林间的疗愈村建筑",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_76e616ca804bdc5d011c",
   "sourceHash": "76e616ca804bdc5d011c8fea1df4b36be028ba8dd38b078e902693ffcffb37fb",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师用黄铜勺将 Nasya（鼻腔疗法）药油滴向一位斜躺患者的面部上方",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a27cbaae21523a7054a0",
   "sourceHash": "a27cbaae21523a7054a07034c7cc7ed5583c6265f915e8f68f71f46127124a97",
   "text": "凭借出色的服务与患者满意度，Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 荣获 TripAdvisor 颁发的 Certificate of Excellence 2018。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a39110b1ad9f4c7a6376",
   "sourceHash": "a39110b1ad9f4c7a637670ae7a1085389d2777ecaa8586653bf325f8a67d6252",
   "text": "凭借出色的服务与患者满意度，Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 荣获 TripAdvisor 颁发的 Certificate of Excellence 2019。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_165589963316684e3f66",
   "sourceHash": "165589963316684e3f6693a5757fa3d454eac0ab7997e73ebff62374f4cb0e20",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 作为领先的阿育吠陀与健康品牌，在 South Asian Travel Awards 2018 中获得表彰。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_147be3dfc1071e73e08e",
   "sourceHash": "147be3dfc1071e73e08ec1a02534bc1b5c79e822b1bc64db64a356443d793190",
   "text": "Kati Vasti 疗法中，Kairali 治疗师正从黄铜器皿中将温热的药油倒入置于斜躺患者下背部的草药面团圈内",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ca2a23e1628a83827497",
   "sourceHash": "ca2a23e1628a83827497293c7e7f48661e449aa92c145c9ba04c5736a17cd4db",
   "text": "戒除药物和酒精成瘾的过程需要全面且个性化的方法，我们已在 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 成功实施这一方法。以下是该过程的概述，帮助您了解我们如何为您的康复提供支持：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_57128f6245babf4e490c",
   "sourceHash": "57128f6245babf4e490c93f08e25c7fae5cf66a6a2932c6db7e92c0559ccb9f8",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]阿育吠陀药物[[CLOSE_1]] Kairali 的阿育吠陀草药制剂承载着家族深厚的传承。Spalabs 由 K.V. Ramesh 先生的父亲 K. S. Vasudevan 医生于 1948 年创立，研制了多款畅销配方和保健品。这些原创配方以正宗的阿育吠陀成分和古代典籍中的传统工艺为基础，在过去六十年间不断改进，形成了我们现代的阿育吠陀草药制剂系列。Kairali 丰富的阿育吠陀产品包括一百种正宗草药、护肤品、身体护理产品和理疗设备，供合作伙伴和加盟商在其门店分销。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
